ps://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-06-05T07:40:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:28:35Z","closed_at":"2025-06-05T15:28:35Z","assignee":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nbisected to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105249\n\n### System information\n\nlinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nspotlights with shadows enabled do not show up in voxelGI.\n\nthis was originally thought to be a problem with my PR and posted as a comment here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106673#issuecomment-2942714831, but it's not related to my PR.\n\nI bisected the issue as a regression related to this PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105249. the following patch which reverts the change for just `scene/3d/voxelizer.cpp` fixes it, but I'm not sure exactly why, so it might be worth looking at other instances of that PR that insert `Math::INF` because it could have caused other similar bugs.\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/scene/3d/voxelizer.cpp b/scene/3d/voxelizer.cpp\nindex 6dd0fda8cb..fbdc667a6e 100644\n--- a/scene/3d/voxelizer.cpp\n+++ b/scene/3d/voxelizer.cpp\n@@ -816,6 +816,7 @@ Vector<int> Voxelizer::get_voxel_gi_level_cell_count() const {\n // https://prideout.net/blog/distance_fields/\n \n #define square(m_s) ((m_s) * (m_s))\n+#define INF 1e20\n \n /* dt of 1d function using squared distance */\n static void edt(float *f, int stride, int n) {\n@@ -825,8 +826,8 @@ static void edt(float *f, int stride, int n) {\n \n \tint k = 0;\n \tv[0] = 0;\n-\tz[0] = -Math::INF;\n-\tz[1] = +Math::INF;\n+\tz[0] = -INF;\n+\tz[1] = +INF;\n \tfor (int q = 1; q <= n - 1; q++) {\n \t\tfloat s = ((f[q * stride] + square(q)) - (f[v[k] * stride] + square(v[k]))) / (2 * q - 2 * v[k]);\n \t\twhile (s <= z[k]) {\n@@ -837,7 +838,7 @@ static void edt(float *f, int stride, int n) {\n \t\tv[k] = q;\n \n \t\tz[k] = s;\n-\t\tz[k + 1] = +Math::INF;\n+\t\tz[k + 1] = +INF;\n \t}\n \n \tk = 0;\n@@ -861,7 +862,7 @@ Voxelizer::BakeResult Voxelizer::get_sdf_3d_image(Vector<uint8_t> &r_image, Bake\n \tuint32_t float_count = octree_size.x * octree_size.y * octree_size.z;\n \tfloat *work_memory = memnew_arr(float, float_count);\n \tfor (uint32_t i = 0; i < float_count; i++) {\n-\t\twork_memory[i] = Math::INF;\n+\t\twork_memory[i] = INF;\n \t}\n \n \tuint32_t y_mult = octree_size.x;\n@@ -944,6 +945,8 @@ Voxelizer::BakeResult Voxelizer::get_sdf_3d_image(Vector<uint8_t> &r_image, Bake\n \treturn BAKE_RESULT_OK;\n }\n \n+#undef INF\n+\n void Voxelizer::_debug_mesh(int p_idx, int p_level, const AABB &p_aabb, Ref<MultiMesh> &p_multimesh, int &idx) {\n \tif (p_level == cell_subdiv - 1) {\n \t\tVector3 center = p_aabb.get_center();\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/621e96df-cc50-477a-9f9e-52c2f7bfe311)\nnote that the harsh circle here is probably incorrect behavior which is fixed by my previously mentioned PR, but for the purposes of *this* issue, the problem is the complete lack of light on the right.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nopen the MRP, select the ShadowOn/VoxelGI node and click \"Bake VoxelGI\". note that since it's a problem with the voxelizer, not the renderer, it can appear wrong until you re-bake.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/files/20602345/voxelgi-spotlight-test-2.zip","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107134/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107134/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}